OL,3,AKanye West's Russia shows officially
OL,4,Acancelled after weeks of uncertainty
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo stadium gigs in Russia by Ye, the
OL,7,Frapper formerly known as Kanye West,
OL,8,Fhave officially been cancelled.
OL,10,FWest had been due to perform at the
OL,11,FGazprom Arena in St Petersburg on 10
OL,12,Fand 11 October.
OL,14,FBut there was confusion in the lead-up
OL,15,Fto the shows, as the venue had said it
OL,16,Fwouldn't host him for what would have
OL,17,Fbeen the biggest show by a western
OL,18,Fartist since Russia invaded Ukraine in
OL,19,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
